    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>140</>，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。使用社交动作<Mark>行礼</>后，暴击提高效果改为攻击提高<Mark>205</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Crit rate increased by <Mark>140</>, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. After using the social action <Mark>Salute</>, the Crit rate increase effect is changed to an Attack increase of <Mark>205</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nCurrent corruption: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
